OL,3,GNEWSAFlooding in West Midlands with
OL,4,Aweather warnings in place
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Significant flooding" hits parts of
OL,7,FBirmingham and Staffordshire after
OL,8,Fheavy rain
OL,10,FOne business owner says she has 'lost
OL,11,Feverything'
OL,13,FThe Met Office has a yellow warning of
OL,14,Fthunderstorms in place for the region
OL,15,Funtil midnight, with some disruption
OL,16,Fanticipated
